# Keys that may approve register entries (scripts/security/registers.py).
# Zone 0: only the owner changes this file.
#
# Each line:  owner namespaces="homelab-register" <key type> <public key>
# CI accepts only FIDO2 keys (sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com). An agent cannot
# use one without a touch on the physical key. Add the public half of a
# second security key as the escrow (keys register K-08).
#
# Make one with:  ssh-keygen -t ed25519-sk -O verify-required -C register-approval
